## 3 · Template: Base Deck Shell

Drop-in working deck with navigation, progress, hash routing, fullscreen, notes, and print CSS.

```html /home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/.codx/profiles/Slides/templates/deck.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Deck Title</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --bg: #0b0b0d;
      --surface: #16161a;
      --surface-2: #1f1f24;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --text: #f4f4f5;
      --text-dim: #a1a1aa;
      --text-muted: #71717a;
      --primary: #6366f1;
      --primary-light: #818cf8;
      --success: #10b981;
      --warning: #f59e0b;
      --error: #ef4444;
      --font: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      --mono: "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, "Courier New", monospace;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    html, body {
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font);
      overflow: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .deck { position: fixed; inset: 0; }

    .slide {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem);
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transform: translateY(12px);
      transition: opacity 320ms var(--ease), transform 320ms var(--ease),
                  visibility 0s 320ms;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .slide.active {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      transform: translateY(0);
      pointer-events: auto;
      transition: opacity 320ms var(--ease), transform 320ms var(--ease),
                  visibility 0s;
    }

    /* --- Typography --- */
    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary-light);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    p, li {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.2rem);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }
    .lead { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.7vw, 1.5rem); line-height: 1.55; }
    strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
    .accent { color: var(--primary-light); }

    /* --- Chrome --- */
    .progress-track {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); z-index: 50;
    }
    .progress-bar {
      height: 100%; width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
      transform-origin: left center; transform: scaleX(0);
      transition: transform 320ms var(--ease);
    }

    .chrome {
      position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 24px; z-index: 50;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      opacity: 0; transition: opacity 200ms var(--ease);
    }
    body:hover .chrome, body.show-chrome .chrome { opacity: 1; }

    .counter {
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0 6px; user-select: none;
    }
    .nav-btn {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px; color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 150ms var(--ease), color 150ms var(--ease),
                  border-color 150ms var(--ease);
    }
    .nav-btn:hover { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--text); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); }
    .nav-btn:active { transform: scale(0.94); }
    .nav-btn:focus-visible, [tabindex]:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary); outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    /* --- Speaker notes --- */
    .notes { display: none; }
    body.notes-on .notes {
      display: block; position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.96); border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 16px 24px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-dim);
      z-index: 60; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    /* --- Print --- */
    @media print {
      html, body { overflow: visible; background: #fff; }
      .deck { position: static; }
      .slide {
        position: relative; inset: auto;
        page-break-after: always; opacity: 1 !important;
        visibility: visible !important; transform: none !important;
        pointer-events: auto; min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .chrome, .progress-track, .notes { display: none !important; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .slide { transition: none !important; transform: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Deck progress">
    <div class="progress-bar" data-progress></div>
  </div>

  <main class="deck">
    <!-- ═══ Slide 1 · Cover ═══ -->
    <section class="slide active">
      <p class="eyebrow">Q4 2026 · Product Review</p>
      <h1>Deck Title Goes Here</h1>
      <p class="lead">A one-line promise of what the audience will learn.</p>
      <aside class="notes">Opening line: thank the room, state the one takeaway.</aside>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Slide 2 · Bullets ═══ -->
    <section class="slide">
      <p class="eyebrow">Context</p>
      <h1>What we set out to solve</h1>
      <ul style="list-style:none;display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:12px;max-width:56ch;">
        <li>· Replace bullet content with one clear claim per line.</li>
        <li>· Keep the list to six items or fewer.</li>
        <li>· Every bullet should be readable from the back of the room.</li>
      </ul>
      <aside class="notes">Expand each bullet for 20 seconds.</aside>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Slide 3 · Metrics ═══ -->
    <section class="slide">
      <p class="eyebrow">Impact</p>
      <h1>The numbers that matter</h1>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:64px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:var(--primary-light);">4.2×</div>
          <div style="color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:8px;">Faster iteration cycle</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:var(--primary-light);">98%</div>
          <div style="color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:8px;">Task success rate</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Slide 4 · Closing ═══ -->
    <section class="slide" style="text-align:center;align-items:center;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Thank you</p>
      <h1>Questions?</h1>
      <p class="lead">you@company.com · @handle</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="chrome">
    <button class="nav-btn" data-prev aria-label="Previous slide">‹</button>
    <span class="counter" data-counter>01 / 04</span>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-next aria-label="Next slide">›</button>
    <button class="nav-btn" data-fullscreen aria-label="Toggle fullscreen">⛶</button>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var slides = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.slide'));
      var total = slides.length;
      if (!total) return;

      var counter = document.querySelector('[data-counter]');
      var progress = document.querySelector('[data-progress]');
      var index = 0;

      function pad(n) { return String(n).padStart(2, '0'); }

      function render() {
        slides.forEach(function (s, i) { s.classList.toggle('active', i === index); });
        if (counter) counter.textContent = pad(index + 1) + ' / ' + pad(total);
        if (progress) progress.style.transform = 'scaleX(' + ((index + 1) / total) + ')';
        if (history.replaceState) history.replaceState(null, '', '#' + (index + 1));
        else location.hash = '#' + (index + 1);
      }

      function go(i) { index = Math.max(0, Math.min(total - 1, i)); render(); }
      function next() { go(index + 1); }
      function prev() { go(index - 1); }

      function toggleFullscreen() {
        if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
          if (document.documentElement.requestFullscreen) document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();
        } else if (document.exitFullscreen) {
          document.exitFullscreen();
        }
      }

      document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
        var k = e.key;
        if (k === 'ArrowRight' || k === 'ArrowDown' || k === 'PageDown' || k === ' ') {
          e.preventDefault(); next();
        } else if (k === 'ArrowLeft' || k === 'ArrowUp' || k === 'PageUp') {
          e.preventDefault(); prev();
        } else if (k === 'Home') { e.preventDefault(); go(0); }
        else if (k === 'End') { e.preventDefault(); go(total - 1); }
        else if (k === 'f' || k === 'F') { toggleFullscreen(); }
        else if (k === 's' || k === 'S') { document.body.classList.toggle('notes-on'); }
      });

      document.querySelectorAll('[data-next]').forEach(function (b) { b.addEventListener('click', next); });
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-prev]').forEach(function (b) { b.addEventListener('click', prev); });
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-fullscreen]').forEach(function (b) { b.addEventListener('click', toggleFullscreen); });

      // Touch swipe (mobile)
      var startX = null;
      document.addEventListener('touchstart', function (e) { startX = e.touches[0].clientX; }, { passive: true });
      document.addEventListener('touchend', function (e) {
        if (startX === null) return;
        var dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - startX;
        if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) { dx < 0 ? next() : prev(); }
        startX = null;
      }, { passive: true });

      // Deep-link
      var fromHash = parseInt((location.hash || '').replace('#', ''), 10);
      if (!isNaN(fromHash)) index = Math.max(0, Math.min(total - 1, fromHash - 1));
      render();
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

---

## 4 · Template: Slide-Type Library

Every archetype as a copy-paste block. Same shell/CSS as above — just swap the `<section>` contents.

```html /home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/.codx/profiles/Slides/templates/slides.html
<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SLIDE ARCHETYPE LIBRARY  ·  paste any block into deck.html
     Each <section> is self-contained and drops into <main class="deck">.
