---

## How to Present It

**Controls:** `→ / ← / Space / PageUp / PageDown` · `Home / End` · `F` fullscreen · `S` speaker notes.

**Export to PDF:** `Cmd / Ctrl + P` → Landscape → **Background graphics ON**. One slide per page.

**What the deck demonstrates by existing:** every archetype it describes — cover, divider, bullets, metrics, two-column, code, chips catalog, grid, and closing — is rendered live. Edit `presentation.html` directly to remix it.
